  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 13.4% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $3.58B (13.4% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/381448/microsoft-alphabet-goldman-sachs-growing-list-objecting-tokenized-stocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Microsoft, Alphabet, Goldman Sachs Join Growing List of Companies Objecting to Tokenized Stocks</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/dune-launches-real-time-data-feeds-covering-200-onchain-trading-venues?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dune launches real-time data feeds covering 200 onchain trading venues</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNXzRrMGh6VG05NmdzNU5vVFNRYm5oeUZtYTFCc0pnWFZfeUVSRXFIZG9UQ2NncEJtV0J5bWFZXzNDQjdRXzV1a09mVTNRSnV0Y1IzU3UtWWRUTDdiSjBqU2t4Mm9oQmt3NENUTndZTWx1M3FkaXlKcURhWG5kQmJPWjlOem9fNDhiclN3VjJrM1NwY181N3VHRXNQdENyMUJX?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Upbit explores U.S. market after meetings with SEC and CFTC Chairs | CoinDesk Videos</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/opinion/uk-crypto-rules-regulated-defi-access?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The UK needs a workable route to regulated DeFi access</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
